---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="prose">
      <h1>About</h1>

      <p>
        I'm {site.name}. I build software for a living and I build things for the sake of
        building on my own time. This blog is the long-term record of both: the things I
        study, the things I create, and the way I think while doing it.
      </p>

      <h2>The maxim</h2>

      <blockquote>
        "Each hour of study should ideally leave an artifact. Knowledge that produces nothing
        tends to disappear."
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        I learned the hard way that passive learning evaporates. Reading, watching, and even
        completing exercises fade fast if nothing survives them. So I follow a simple rule:
        <strong> every hour of study ends with an artifact</strong> — a note, a sketch, a post,
        a small piece of code, a finished game.
      </p>

      <h2>What lives here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Essays</strong> — long-form writing where I internalize complex topics.
          Writing about something is how I actually learn it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Notes</strong> — small, frequent artifacts. A lesson, an observation, a
          decision, a tiny win. They ship fast on purpose.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Projects</strong> — the open source work and the small games I make and
          maintain on my own.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <p>
        This site is the source of truth. From here, content is repurposed into shorter forms
        on other networks — so an essay becomes a thread, a post, a video. Everything points
        back here, and this points back to my other work.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/gui-henri">github.com/gui-henri</a></li>
        <li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a></li>
        <li><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
